      "limitations": [
        "Each pixel is the median of the laser shots in a 1/128 degree bin; where a bin holds no shot the producer interpolated a value (PDS: about 55 % of bins near the equator hold at least one shot, with gaps up to 12 km between ground tracks), so slopes there are smoothed. There is no void value: interpolated pixels cannot be told from measured ones.",
